      {"defect":"Brand wordmark 'Vaultly' and H1 'Welcome' are identical font size/weight, creating a flat, confusing hierarchy. User doesn't know if they're looking at an app title or a greeting.","fix":"Make 'Vaultly' the visual anchor: increase to ~32-36px Bold (or use a logo mark). Demote 'Welcome' to ~24-28px SemiBold or Medium. The subhead 'Sign in to continue' is currently garbled/colliding—fix that to be clearly tertiary (~16px Regular)."},
      {"defect":"Primary action 'Sign In' button blends slightly with input fields due to similar container treatment; lacks sufficient visual weight for a fintech CTA.","fix":"Increase button height to 56px (touch-friendly), ensure it's the only element using the saturated primary blue (#0066FF range). Add subtle inner shadow or top highlight to give it 'pressable' depth."}
    ],
    "2_spacing": [
      {"defect":"Vertical rhythm is inconsistent and too loose for a 'tightened spacing' request. Gap between 'Welcome' header and subhead is arbitrary; gap between inputs is larger than necessary.","fix":"Enforce strict 8px grid: Status bar (0), Brand (24px), Welcome (16px), Subhead (24px), Email label (8px), Email input (16px), Password label (8px), Password input (12px), Forgot link (24px), Sign In button (16px), Footer links."},
      {"defect":"Horizontal padding appears to be ~20-24px but inputs don't feel properly contained within a safe area gutter system.","fix":"Set fixed 24px left/right margins for all content. Ensure input fields span full width minus these gutters (e.g., 327px on 375px viewport)."}
    ],
