      {"defect":"Background is a flat near-black (#0D1117) which is fine, but input fields use a mid-gray that creates low contrast with borders, making them look disabled or muddy.","fix":"Use layered surfaces: Background #0B1120, Input backgrounds #1E293B (slate-800), Input borders #334155 (slite-700) with focus state #3B82F6 (blue-500). Ensure text inside inputs is #F1F5F9 (slate-100) for >4.5:1 contrast."},
      {"defect":"'Trust blue' primary button is neon/electric blue (#0055FF approx) which feels like a generic SaaS template rather than institutional fintech trust.","fix":"Deepen to a more authoritative 'banking blue': #2563EB (blue-600) or #1D4ED8 (blue-700). Reserve brighter blues only for interactive states (hover/pressed)."}
