      {"defect":"Subheading text is corrupted/garbled ('hackcontinue')—looks like rendering artifact or bad OCR layering over the design.","fix":"Replace with clean 'Sign in to continue' in 16px Regular (#94A3B8 slate-400). Ensure no overlapping elements."},
      {"defect":"Font choice appears to be system San Francisco/Helvetica which is acceptable, but weight distribution is binary (only Bold vs Regular).","fix":"Establish type scale: Brand (36/Bold), H1 (28/SemiBold), Label (14/Medium), Input (16/Regular), Button (16/Semibold), Caption (14/Regular). Use -apple-system or Inter for fintech crispness."}
