      {"defect":"Input field border radius looks closer to 10-14px than requested 12px, and lacks consistent stroke width (appears 1px, should be 1.5px for definition).","fix":"Hard-set all corner radii to exactly 12px. Set border to 1.5px solid. Add 48-52px height to inputs for thumb accessibility."},
      {"defect":"Password field eye icon and email envelope icon are low-opacity gray, nearly invisible against the dark input background (accessibility failure).","fix":"Increase icon opacity to 60-70% (#64748B slate-500) or match label color. Ensure tap targets are 44px minimum around icons."},
      {"defect":"'Secure login' shield icon at bottom is tiny and orphaned; looks like an afterthought rather than trust signal.","fix":"Enlarge icon to 16px, pair with 13px text, center-align as a footer group, or move to below the password field as inline reassurance."}
