      {"defect":"'Forgot password?' link is right-aligned while 'Email'/'Password' labels are left-aligned, creating a zig-zag eye path. The button is centered/full-width but text inside is centered (acceptable but less scannable than left-aligned).","fix":"Keep labels left-aligned. Move 'Forgot password?' to right-align *above* the button (standard pattern) or keep right-aligned below password but ensure baseline aligns with input bottom edge. Left-align button text for faster scanning (fintech convention)."},
      {"defect":"Bottom footer 'Don't have an account? Sign up' is centered but vertically floating in excessive whitespace.","fix":"Group footer elements, align center, but pin to bottom with minimum 32px margin from screen edge."}
